abstract: >-
  A curated collection of 118 domain skills plus 5 cross-cutting meta skills
  for AI agents working alongside researchers, academics, graduate students,
  postdocs, and R&D engineers. Covers the full research lifecycle: literature
  search, experimental design, bioinformatics analysis, scientific writing,
  grant writing, peer review, publication, ethics, and mentorship. v0.4.0
  introduces a hardened schema with required Hard Rules, Cross-references,
  and Changelog sections; a Material Passport schema for inter-skill
  handoffs; five end-to-end reference pipelines; a runnable RNA-seq
  showcase; and five meta skills (roadmap-author, integrity-audit,
  release-management, cross-reference-mapper, agent-handoff) for authoring,
  auditing, releasing, mapping, and chaining ORS skills.
references:
